  "agentGuide": "Base path /drive/v3. Search: GET /files?q=name contains 'report' and trashed = false&fields=files(id,name,mimeType,modifiedTime,size,webViewLink)&pageSize=20 (q also: '<folder id>' in parents, mimeType = 'application/vnd.google-apps.folder', fullText contains 'words', modifiedTime > '2026-01-01T00:00:00'). One file: GET /files/<id>?fields=*; download a binary: GET /files/<id>?alt=media (use save_as); a Google Doc/Sheet as text or PDF: GET /files/<id>/export?mimeType=text/plain (application/pdf, text/csv for a sheet). Create a folder: POST /files {\"name\": \"...\", \"mimeType\": \"application/vnd.google-apps.folder\", \"parents\": [\"<id>\"]}; move: PATCH /files/<id>?addParents=<new>&removeParents=<old>; rename: PATCH /files/<id> {\"name\": \"...\"}; trash: PATCH /files/<id> {\"trashed\": true}. Share: POST /files/<id>/permissions {\"role\": \"reader\", \"type\": \"user\", \"emailAddress\": \"...\"} (anyone: type \"anyone\"). Shared drives: GET /drives. Uploads of new content go through the upload endpoint, which this relay does not offer: prefer a Doc created through Google Docs.",
